<title>POLAND: Polish dwellings output up 22.9 pct m/m in June.</title>
<headline>Polish dwellings output up 22.9 pct m/m in June.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of dwellings completed in June rose 22.9 percent from May and was 9.3 percent higher than in June 1996, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said 4,768 flats were completed in June bringing the total for the January-June period to 25,696 flats.</p>
<p> POLISH HOUSING OUTPUT	   JUNE	MAY	 JUNE 1996</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)	22.9	1.5	   53.9</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)		 9.3     16.6	  -23.0</p>
<p> Number of flats built	   4,768    3,880	 4,362</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
